.TH "CODEX-NOTIFY" "1" "November 2026" "arran4/dotfiles" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
codex\-notify \- send a Codex attention notification
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBcodex\-notify [approval|question|complete|attention]\fR
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show a short notification for Codex approval, question, completion or general attention events. This internal libexec hook uses notify\-send, kdialog or macOS osascript when available, falling back to a terminal bell.
.SH NOTES
Normally invoked by Codex hooks, not directly by the user.
